docs {
  The full lifecycle of an owned resource: create, read back, list, update, and
  soft-delete. Runs entirely as `owner`.

  Cross-user access is deliberately NOT tested here — it lives in
  `03-authorization`, so this folder stays a readable happy path and the
  security assertions are somewhere a reviewer can find them all at once.
}
